# FACTORY L-105（项目方 11-02 03:1x：“允许服务器常驻托管”；规则 K-OPS-F10）：服务器出图监督 producer，systemd --user 托管
# 安装：bash ops/factory/systemd/install.sh <host>（随 sv 发版，不在服务器上手写）
[Unit]
Description=NS-Final Studio producer (FACTORY, %u)
After=network-online.target ns-fwd.service
Wants=ns-fwd.service
StartLimitIntervalSec=600
StartLimitBurst=5

[Service]
Type=simple
EnvironmentFile=%h/work/fredw/ns_factory_systemd/host.env
WorkingDirectory=/root/work/fredw/offline_20261101/repo
ExecStart=/root/work/fredw/offline_20261101/venv/bin/python -u tools/autopilot/producer.py serve
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=15
KillSignal=SIGTERM
TimeoutStopSec=30
Nice=5
StandardOutput=append:/root/work/fredw/offline_20261101/logs/producer.out
StandardError=append:/root/work/fredw/offline_20261101/logs/producer.out

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
